# OpenWeatherMap API key — optional. When set, the recommendation page
# fetches live Vilnius weather on mount and pre-selects the matching
# option in the "Oro sąlygos" picker. Get a free key at
# https://openweathermap.org/api (sign up + verify; the free tier covers
# 1,000 calls/day, plenty for a tutorial app).
#
# When unset, the picker stays manual — no behaviour change.
VITE_OWM_API_KEY=""
